 "containerId": null, "originalText": "stop() → AbortSignal → model & tool\ngrace paksa 30 dtk bila tak berhenti\nidle 5 mnt · maks 4 jam ·\nprovider: output pertama 2 mnt,\nantar-output 60 dtk", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e263e0d9e7724eb2900c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 650, "width": 780, "height": 147.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["f336dae3c0414e3199ed"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1369205674, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 813441228, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "335b3642b1b549e58e7a", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 664, "width": 212.4, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["f336dae3c0414e3199ed"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 730996476, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1555844151, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Klien: readAssistantTurn", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Klien: readAssistantTurn", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "d9684d762e134ade9a92", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 695.8, "width": 330.0, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["f336dae3c0414e3199ed"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1877266720, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1674273375, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "readSseFrames (lib/sse.ts) memecah byte → frame\ntiap frame diberi `seq` dari baris id:\nTurnCursor {chatId, turnId, lastSeq} diperbarui\nregistry turn (assistantTurns.ts) menaruh event ke\nplaceholder asisten → React merender", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "readSseFrames (lib/sse.ts) memecah byte → frame\ntiap frame diberi `seq` dari baris id:\nTurnCursor {chatId, turnId, lastSeq} diperbarui\nregistry turn (assistantTurns.ts) menaruh event ke\nplaceholder asisten → React merender", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "40178987d70941e9b74c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 880, "y": 650, "width": 780, "height": 147.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["add801779f5848e8851c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1471847587, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 668096723, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "bfd8c8c4cf3042f1a6d6", "type": "text", "x": 894, "y": 664, "width": 300.2, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["add801779f5848e8851c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1309919088, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1373765310, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Klien terputus (tab tutup / jaringan)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Klien terputus (tab tutup / jaringan)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "700d0474a3b7493486f9", "type": "text", "x": 894, "y": 695.8, "width": 478.9, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["add801779f5848e8851c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1915841903, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 499263613, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Server TIDAK berhenti — generasi lanjut.\nBuka lagi: GET /chat/:chatId → active_turn {id, seq, assistant_message_id}\n→ GET /chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stream?from=lastSeq+1\n→ server memutar ulang frame seq ≥ from, lalu live.\nRun sudah selesai & lewat 60 dtk → baca dari DB (pesan tersimpan).", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Server TIDAK berhenti — generasi lanjut.\nBuka lagi: GET /chat/:chatId → active_turn {id, seq, assistant_message_id}\n→ GET /chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stream?from=lastSeq+1\n→ server memutar ulang frame seq ≥ from, lalu live.\nRun sudah selesai & lewat 60 dtk → baca dari DB (pesan tersimpan).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e2b9a2eda5184fe6a2fa", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1700, "y": 650, "width": 780, "height": 147.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["42d2ad13a49c48d2bc7d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 40155600, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1464792134, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ca0e9a1bfc8a4acda92f", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 672.8, "width": 96.8, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["42d2ad13a49c48d2bc7d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1341875480, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 361798840, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stop & 409", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Stop & 409", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ee7373f345424fcb8bb2", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 704.5, "width": 495.9, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["42d2ad13a49c48d2bc7d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 964124518, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1435628914, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tombol Stop → POST /chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stop (satu-satunya pembatal).\nPOST /chat saat run aktif → 409 turn_in_progress; pesan input yang baru\ndisimpan dihapus (discardRejectedChatInput). UI memasang ulang ke run itu.\nHak: melihat chat cukup untuk reattach; Stop & kirim butuh content.edit.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tombol Stop → POST /chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stop (satu-satunya pembatal).\nPOST /chat saat run aktif → 409 turn_in_progress; pesan input yang baru\ndisimpan dihapus (discardRejectedChatInput). UI memasang ulang ke run itu.\nHak: melihat chat cukup untuk reattach; Stop & kirim butuh content.edit.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "2ca6bf1c010e41089929", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 900, "width": 2400, "height": 136.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["34271c17b6d04ee38ad0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1010336564, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 638478609, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "5ccfeb1e65b04c138fd8", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 914, "width": 143.2, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["34271c17b6d04ee38ad0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 651042670, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 138006002, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Kenapa begini?", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Kenapa begini?", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "f128a3e2267245bda0af", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 947.0, "width": 678.9, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["34271c17b6d04ee38ad0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1103720811, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 157713737, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "• Browser boleh mati/reload tanpa kehilangan jawaban: run milik SERVER, bukan koneksi.\n• Konsekuensi: run ada di memori satu proses → deployment harus satu replika atau sticky routing.\n• Ditutup tab ≠ batal. Satu-satunya pembatal adalah endpoint stop (atau deadline).\n• Frame ber-nomor + buffer = reattach tanpa kehilangan / duplikasi (klien minta from=lastSeq+1).", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• Browser boleh mati/reload tanpa kehilangan jawaban: run milik SERVER, bukan koneksi.\n• Konsekuensi: run ada di memori satu proses → deployment harus satu replika atau sticky routing.\n• Ditutup tab ≠ batal. Satu-satunya pembatal adalah endpoint stop (atau deadline).\n• Frame ber-nomor + buffer = reattach tanpa kehilangan / duplikasi (klien minta from=lastSeq+1).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "c34cd1018bb64a7d8cd0", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 20, "width": 798.7, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1794974279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1621595779, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Chat — protokol SSE, run milik server, reattach & Stop", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Chat — protokol SSE, run milik server, reattach & Stop", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "b07caebb5420482ab679", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 66, "width": 772.7, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1726423519, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1817095994, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172995, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "lib/streamRuns.ts · lib/assistantTurnRuns.ts · frontend lib/assistantTurnStream.ts, assistantTurns.ts, sse.ts", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "lib/streamRuns.ts · lib/assistantTurnRuns.ts · frontend lib/assistantTurnStream.ts, assistantTurns.ts, sse.ts", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1d17812ee84b43ddacd0", "type": "arrow", "x": 480, "y": 473.6, "width": 160, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transpare